<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cinfo</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cinfo                  the whole roster of your clan
cinfo master           who leads the clan
cinfo lord             the clan's lords
cinfo treasurer        who keeps the treasury
cinfo quartermaster    who keeps the equipment
</pre>
<p>Shows the members of your clan, with each one's rank title and position 
(Master, Lord, Treasurer, Quartermaster). A * marks the members who are in 
the game right now. The words can be shortened, for example cinfo treas.
</p><p>Any member of a clan can use cinfo. To see all the clans, see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Clist</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clist</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cappoint</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Crank</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>